    <string name="legal_about_title">About this app</string>
    <string name="legal_about_body">KoePocket is an unofficial viewer for personal use, for browsing the audio board Koe-Koe (koe-koe.com). It is not affiliated with Koe-Koe\'s operators or posters, and is not an official app.</string>
    <string name="legal_disclaimer_title">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="legal_disclaimer_body">• Contains adult content (audio). Not for anyone under 18 or in high school or below (following Koe-Koe\'s terms of use).\n• Copyright of audio and text belongs to the posters and Koe-Koe. Use saved audio only for private enjoyment; do not copy, redistribute, repost or transmit it publicly.\n• Follow Koe-Koe\'s terms of use. The app may stop working without notice due to changes to the terms, specifications or site structure.\n• This app is provided as is. The author is not liable for any damage arising from its use.\n• Even if a post is removed from the site, audio saved on your device remains. Decide how to handle it at your own responsibility.</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_body">• Data is stored only on your device. Favorites, folders, the saved list, search history, settings and downloaded audio files are all kept on the device and are never sent to the author or any third-party server.\n• There is no account registration or login. No personal information is collected.\n• No analytics, ads or crash reporting are included.\n• The only server contacted is Koe-Koe (koe-koe.com). Your device accesses it directly to show lists, play and download audio.\n• The screen content is hidden from the recent apps list and screenshots (can be changed in Settings).\n• Temporary data (cache) for lists and detail pages you have viewed is stored on the device. You can delete it in Settings.\n• Saved audio is placed in your device\'s Music folder (Music/KoePocket), so it may also appear in other music and file manager apps.\n• Cloud backup is disabled. Uninstalling the app removes your lists and settings. Downloaded audio files (by default in Music/KoePocket) remain on the device, so delete them if needed.</string>
